| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 1 U
| |-CXXRecordDecl struct Pair definition
| | |-FieldDecl a 'T'
| | `-FieldDecl b 'U'
| |-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct Pair
| | |-TemplateArgument type 'int'
| | `-TemplateArgument type 'int'
| `-ClassTemplateSpecializationDecl struct Pair definition implicit_instantiation
|   |-TemplateArgument type 'short'
|   |-TemplateArgument type 'short'
|   |-FieldDecl a 'short'
|   `-FieldDecl b 'short'
